  "description": "<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial;\">Become a KenJo Sabers affiliate and promote the best rated lightsaber shop. We are located in the Netherlands and ship worldwide but we see most of our customers are currently from Europe. We are proud to be rated 4.9 Excellent on Trustpilot. As being huge Star Wars and Lightsaber fans ourselves we only sell sabers and electronics which make us enthusiastic. We are known for going the extra mile for our customers before and after purchase. Customer satisfaction, quality and superb customer service is our main priority. .</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial;\">Our standard program offers a 10% commission based on sales. Our main products vary&nbsp; from &euro;99 to &euro;1000 so with the right reach you will be able to build op commission quite fast. We might occasionally send you additional products to try out or promote. Also we are always open to sponsoring a giveaway.</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial;\"><br><br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial;\">Customers looking for a lightsaber often are overwhelmed with different vendors. Most of our customers choose KenJo Sabers due to our high quality reliable sabers, large assortment, different categories, multiple soundboard options. And of course as mentioned our simply superb customer service.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial;\">We like to work with people who also really like our brand and our products and therefore we look for continued long lasting partnerships with our affiliates. Our Uppromote Marketplace program offers 10% commission and the ability to earn free sabers. After signing up we may contact you to join our exclusive Content Creator program if we think that would be a better fit for you. It offers additional bonuses per referral threshold.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial;\">There are some rules and requirements we would like you to meet, just check out the terms in the subscription section. Do you love our brand, sabers and do you think you will be a great addition to our team? We are very much looking forward to your application.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial;\"><br><br></span></p>",
